#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md
#: 665118ee924a4fa0ab15a641369860a0
msgid ""
"Understand what GWexpy validates publicly for notebooks, direct I/O formats,"
" algorithm audit notes, and repository coverage signals, and where each "
"evidence source lives."
msgstr ""
"GWexpy が公開で検証している範囲（ノートブック、direct I/O 形式、アルゴリズム監査ノート、リポジトリの coverage "
"シグナル）と、各根拠の所在を整理します。"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:7
#: 8edb9900e3214d129eec1e06866219f7
msgid "Verification and Quality Signals"
msgstr "検証と品質の見方"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:9
#: 3a7e8ab5e3864a778ffae5dd08e4d3c1
msgid ""
"This page explains what kinds of public verification signals `gwexpy` "
"exposes today, where those signals come from, and how to interpret their "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"このページでは、`gwexpy` が現在どの種類の検証シグナルを公開しているか、その根拠がどこにあるか、そしてその限界をどう読むべきかを整理します。"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:11
#: 0bd581933e764f5bb948b9742e331613
msgid ""
"It is not a single \"all features are verified\" claim. Instead, it points "
"you to the current evidence sources for notebooks, direct I/O formats, "
"algorithm audits, and repository-level coverage reporting."
msgstr ""
"ここで示すのは「すべての機能が一様に検証済み」という主張ではありません。Notebook、direct I/O、アルゴリズム監査、リポジトリ全体の "
"coverage について、それぞれ別の根拠に辿れるようにするための案内ページです。"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:14
#: acf33b4fc56240898e7713942bf7d958
msgid "**Read this page as a transparency map, not as a blanket guarantee**"
msgstr "**このページは「透明性の地図」であって、一括保証ではありません**"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:16
#: c8a85c2ffc5f476c9d0dd7516cda95a9
msgid ""
"Different parts of the project are verified in different ways. Some "
"module/docstring examples are exercised in nightly CI, some notebooks are "
"fully executed, some heavy notebooks are only structure-checked, and some "
"optional-dependency tests can be skipped when the backend is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"検証の方法は対象ごとに異なります。module / docstring 例が Nightly CI で検証される部分もあれば、Notebook の中には"
" CI で全実行されるものもあり、重い notebook のように構造確認中心のものもあります。optional dependency "
"を持つテストは、環境によって skip される場合もあります。"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:19
#: 5342d223c812402fad36642a946c74c7
